# Production env baked into `bun run build` (vite mode=production).
# These are public values — anyone visiting the site sees them in the
# Network tab. Do NOT put secrets here.
#
# Auth goes through the web origin: Vercel proxies /api/* to the sync
# server (static/vercel.json), so the session cookie is first-party for
# the web and login works in browsers that block third-party cookies.
# Native shells use the same base. The Triplit WebSocket can't go through
# Vercel rewrites and authenticates with a JWT, so it stays direct.
#
# The app lives at app.innerio.frederickandrade.com; the bare domain is the
# public landing (repo innerio-web, ADR-040).
VITE_AUTH_SERVER=https://app.innerio.frederickandrade.com
VITE_TRIPLIT_SERVER=https://innerio-api.dohkku.dev
